{%- comment -%}
  Daycare label personalizer — no app required.

  INSTALL
    1. Theme assets
       Upload every file from daycare-pdp-assets.zip into the theme's Assets
       folder (75 files: 34 backgrounds, 25 icons, 16 fonts). Shopify CLI is
       faster than the admin uploader: shopify theme push --only assets
    2. Snippet
       Save this file as snippets/daycare-personalizer.liquid
    3. Render it INSIDE the product form, in sections/main-product.liquid,
       between the variant picker and the buy buttons:
         {% render 'daycare-personalizer' %}
       Rendering it inside the form matters. The block also re-attaches its
       hidden inputs if the theme re-renders the form, but native placement is
       cleaner.
    4. Lock each product to one icon set, either by passing it:
         {% render 'daycare-personalizer', icon_set: 'Dolphin' %}
       or by setting a product metafield custom.icon_set (single line text) to
       one of: Animal, Dinosaurs, Dolphin, Space, Sports.
       Left blank, the customer picks the set themselves.
    5. PRINT FILES (high-res originals, Content > Files me)
         Icons       print_ANIMAL_1.png ... print_ANIMAL_5.png
                     print_DINOSAURS_1.png, print_DOLPHIN_1.png,
                     print_SPACE_1.png, print_SPORT_1.png ... (har set 1 se 5)
         Backgrounds print_LABEL_1.svg, print_LABEL_2.svg ... print_LABEL_34.svg
                     (LABEL_N = backgrounds list me N-th background)
       Backgrounds: SVG (width/height ya viewBox ke saath) ya at least 1800x600 px.
       Icons: at least ~520 px tall, same aspect ratio as the preview version.
       If a print_ file is missing, the preview image is used instead.

  WHAT REACHES THE ORDER
    Line item properties: Design, Icon, Background, Name, Font, Text color, a
    hidden _spec holding the exact asset ids, and 2 files:
      - Preview           small PNG (450x150), sirf dikhane ke liye
      - Print file (SVG)  label-PRINT.svg, exactly 1.5in x 0.5in. Background
                          vector hi rehta hai (agar print_LABEL SVG hai), icon
                          original high-res PNG se, aur text OUTLINES (paths)
                          me convert hota hai, isliye kisi bhi software/printer
                          me font ki zarurat nahi.

  NOTES FOR THE DEVELOPER
    - No app, no external requests. Fonts and art are served from theme assets.
    - Images load on demand, so the page does not pull the full set up front.
    - Requires no theme settings and touches no other file.
    - To restyle, override the .dc- classes; nothing uses !important.
    - Print PNG has a full rectangle (no rounded corners, no bleed). Cutting
      is done by the printer's die-line.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign dc_set = icon_set | default: product.metafields.custom.icon_set -%}
{%- assign dc_id = 'dc-' | append: section.id | default: 'dc-personalizer' -%}

<style>
  @media (min-width: 750px){
  .product__media-wrapper{
    align-self: flex-start;      /* grid item ko poori height na mile, tabhi sticky chalega */
    position: sticky;
    top: 20px;
  }
  .product__media-wrapper .dc-preview{
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
}

  .dc-wrap{--dc-line:#e2e2e6;--dc-ink:#1d1d20;--dc-mute:#6b6b76;--dc-accent:#1f5f57;
  font-family:inherit;color:var(--dc-ink);max-width:640px;margin:0 0 28px}
.dc-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box}
.dc-wrap h3{font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:600;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline}
.dc-wrap h3 span{font-weight:400;color:var(--dc-mute);font-size:.85rem;margin-left:auto}
.dc-step{margin-bottom:22px}
.dc-hint{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dc-mute)}

.dc-preview{background:#f5f5f7;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:22px;text-align:center}
.dc-preview canvas{height:auto;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.16))}
.dc-warn{margin:10px 0 0;color:#b4472b;font-size:.85rem;min-height:1.1em}

.dc-themes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.dc-th{border:1px solid var(--dc-line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;
  padding:7px 16px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.9rem}
.dc-th[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--dc-accent);background:var(--dc-accent);color:#fff}

.dc-icons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px;max-width:360px}
.dc-ic{border:2px solid var(--dc-line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:6px;cursor:pointer;aspect-ratio:1}
.dc-ic img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.dc-ic[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--dc-accent)}

.dc-bgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(64px,1fr));gap:7px}
.dc-sw{border:2px solid var(--dc-line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:3px;cursor:pointer}
.dc-sw img{width:100%;height:20px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px;display:block}
.dc-sw[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--dc-accent)}

.dc-wrap textarea{width:100%;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--dc-line);
  border-radius:10px;font:inherit;resize:vertical;min-height:72px}
.dc-wrap textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--dc-accent);outline-offset:1px}
.dc-count{text-align:right;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--dc-mute);margin-top:4px}

.dc-fonts{border:1px solid var(--dc-line);border-radius:10px;max-height:250px;overflow:auto}
.dc-fo{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--dc-line);
  background:#fff;padding:9px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.35;
  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.dc-fo:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.dc-fo[aria-pressed="true"]{background:#eef4f3;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--dc-accent)}

.dc-colors{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(40px,1fr));gap:9px}
.dc-dot{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.18);cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.dc-dot[aria-pressed="true"]{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #fff,0 0 0 4px var(--dc-accent)}

@media (max-width:560px){
  .dc-icons{max-width:none}
  .dc-fo{font-size:1.1rem}
}
.product-form__quantity ,
.product--no-media .product-form__quantity
{
  display:none;
}
</style>

<div class="dc-wrap" id="{{ dc_id }}">
  <div class="dc-preview">
    <canvas data-dc="canvas" aria-label="Preview of your label"></canvas>
    <p class="dc-warn" data-dc="warn"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step" data-dc="themestep">
    <h3>1. Choose your design</h3>
    <div class="dc-themes" data-dc="themes"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step">
    <h3>2. Choose your icon</h3>
    <div class="dc-icons" data-dc="icons"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step">
    <h3>3. Choose your background <span data-dc="bgname"></span></h3>
    <div class="dc-bgs" data-dc="bgs"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step">
    <h3>4. Enter the name</h3>
    <p class="dc-hint">Press Enter for a second line. Long names shrink to fit.</p>
    <textarea data-dc="name" maxlength="100" rows="2" placeholder="Grace Turner"></textarea>
    <div class="dc-count"><span data-dc="count">0 / 100</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step">
    <h3>5. Choose your font <span data-dc="fontname"></span></h3>
    <div class="dc-fonts" data-dc="fonts"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="dc-step">
    <h3>6. Choose your text color <span data-dc="colorname"></span></h3>
    <div class="dc-colors" data-dc="colors"></div>
  </div>

  <div data-dc="props" hidden>
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Design]" data-prop="Design">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Icon]" data-prop="Icon">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Background]" data-prop="Background">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Name]" data-prop="Name">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Font]" data-prop="Font">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[Text color]" data-prop="Text color">
    <input type="hidden" name="properties[_spec]" data-prop="_spec">
    <input type="file" name="properties[Preview]" data-prop-file="Preview" accept="image/png">
    <input type="file" name="properties[Print file (SVG)]" data-prop-file="Print" accept="image/svg+xml">
</div>
</div>


